- Tables in data/ are computed from GTDB R232 (its list of genomes that failed quality control), NCBI GenBank
  assemblies and SRA reads, with UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot (CC BY 4.0) and Pfam as protein references. The
  Shikimatogenerans genomes of the throscid beetles (BioProject PRJNA1062330, including the proteomes in
  data/throscidae/proteomes/, predicted by us) were sequenced and deposited by J.C. Wierz, H. Malm, M. Kaltenpoth and
  T. Engl (Department of Insect Symbiosis, Max Planck Institute for Chemical Ecology, Jena); their paper on them is
  listed as unpublished.

